e_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/c46c1a7e0d6dc4be0eee795a0fbde481.webm?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/c46c1a7e0d6dc4be0eee795a0fbde481.mp4?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNITE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite with other players to achieve common goals, participate in wars, capture sectors, build bases, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/0a0bd20f9e56f38cfa8ee520f58b3576.poster.avif?t=1750444799\" width=476 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/0a0bd20f9e56f38cfa8ee520f58b3576.webm?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/0a0bd20f9e56f38cfa8ee520f58b3576.mp4?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare to survive on this planet? Veliri awaits you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/75c63072be25fe80db64e3cf5286dc83.poster.avif?t=1750444799\" width=530 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/75c63072be25fe80db64e3cf5286dc83.webm?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828170/extras/75c63072be25fe80db64e3cf5286dc83.mp4?t=1750444799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
